#: ../../zh/triton_api/Extension_Ops/sync_block.md:5
msgid "显式的核心间同步指令，用于协调 Cube-Vector 架构中不同核心间的执行顺序和数据一致性。"
msgstr ""
"Explicit inter-core synchronization instruction used to coordinate execution"
" order and data consistency between different cores in the Cube-Vector "
"architecture."

